            "typeClass": "compound",
            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>I investigated the socio-ecological costs of the most commonly practiced multiple-use forest management by community-based families in the Bolivian Amazon. This database contains the most important socioeconomic and biophysical information of 24 community households belonging to 6 campesino communities.</p>"
                }
              },
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>Dataset includes a file describing the variables collected.</p><p>Most variable values are on a yearly basis. There are only a couple of variable values that are for the last 5 years before data collection. In that case, the 5_years is indicated at the end of the variable name.</p><p>The depositor provided the file 'Socio-ecological costs of ANTimber_4data depository' in XLSX format. DANS added the CSV formats of this file for preservation purposes. The depositor provided the files 'Research documentation_Socio-ecological costs of ANTimber' and 'Appendix 1' in DOCX format. DANS addded the PDF formats of these files.</p>"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
